{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And the water was spent.</b> Rashi explained: because it is the way of the sick to drink a lot. And one may ask, for we say in the chapter המגרל that until Yaakov our father there was no illness. One may answer that until Yaakov no person became ill on his own. But this one [Yishmael] was not ill except on account of Sarah, for she cast an evil eye upon him."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:46.118580815Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}